Z||000000||Conrad Sanville||02-26-2001||05:31 PM||||<BR>During the 80's and early 90's GM used LaserDisc players for interactive sales training and for product information.  They also served as brochures for new models.  <P>I was asked to transfer one onto VHS years ago for a car dealership.  It was on the Fiero and covered its development and the obstacles they had to overcome.<BR>There was also a section on the disc that was to be played to perspective Fiero buyers.<P>Does anyone know of any Pontiac dealerships that would still have the Fiero Laserdisc? I am trying to track down the folks hoping they still have the copy of that disc on tape. I still have a laserdisc player and would like that disc for my collection. <P>Anyone that is remotely interested in Fieros will find the disc incredibly fascinating.  Thanks, Radcon||||reg||1
